# Messaging App

A full-stack messaging application built with React and Laravel.

Users can log in to the application and send messages after authentication.

Project Structure

├── client/    # Frontend application built with React
├── server/    # Backend API built with Laravel
└── README.md

## Database Setup (Docker)

To create and start the database locally, navigate to the server directory and run:

`docker compose --env-file .env up -d`

## JWT Secret Configuration

The application uses JWT for authentication.

Generate a JWT secret key by running:

`php artisan jwt:secret`